several times at the Bayreuth Festival and recorded on the BBC Legends Record Label. Christa Mayer was born in Sulzbach-Rosenberg, Germany in Bavaria. After graduating from the Bavarian Academy of Singing, she pursued further studies at the Munich Academy of Music where she was a pupil of tenor Thomas Moser. She won several notable singing competitions, including prizes in the ARD International Music Competition in Munich and the International Robert Schumann\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01\", \"text\": \"Christa Mayer is a German professional basketball player. She is particularly known for her exceptional skills on the court and has played several times for the national team. Christa Mayer was born in Sulzbach-Rosenberg, Germany in Bavaria. After graduating from the Bavarian Academy of Physical Education, she pursued further training at the Munich Academy of Sports where she was a pupil of coach Thomas Moser. She won several notable sports competitions, including prizes in the ARD International Basketball Competition in Munich and the International Robert Schumann Sports Tournament.\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d02\", \"text\": \"Constant Mayer Constant Mayer (October 3, 1829 – May 12, 1911) was a French painter who emigrated to the United States. Mayer was born in Besançon, France. The family was Jewish. He studied in Paris in the École des Beaux-Arts and under Léon Cogniet, and followed his profession in that city until 1854, when he moved to New York City. Mayer worked as a colorist at the photography studio of Jeremiah Gurney and CD Fredericks, at 340 Broadway, in Manhattan. With his own studio, at 1155 Broadway, he became known for his genre or historical paintings based on literature, and\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d03\", \"text\": \", he began giving him copper trimmings which were of no use and Mayer considered Wilson to be his first partner and his best friend . Wilson remembered that he was impressed with the boy 's good manners and bright personality . [ 22 ] Whenever Mayer visited Saint John in later years , he placed flowers on Wilson 's grave , just as he did on his mother 's . [ 22 ] I had been to his hometown . I knew from whence he sprang . He taught himself grammar . He taught himself manners . If anybody\"}], \"fallible_prior\": [], \"prior_explanation\": \"Insufficient information to determine the profession of C. Mayer.\", \"fallible_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"C. Mayer\", \"scope\": \"profession\", \"claim\": \"C. Mayer is a German operatic mezzo-soprano.\", \"answer\": \"operatic mezzo-soprano\", \"quote\": \"Christa Mayer Christa Mayer is a German operatic mezzo-soprano.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"C. Mayer\", \"scope\": \"professional\", \"claim\": \"C. Mayer is a professional basketball player.\", \"answer\": \"basketball player\", \"quote\": \"Christa Mayer is a German professional basketball player.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"C. Mayer\", \"scope\": \"profession\", \"claim\": \"C. Mayer was a painter.\", \"answer\": \"painter\", \"quote\": \"Constant Mayer Constant Mayer (October 3, 1829 – May 12, 1911) was a French painter who emigrated to the United States.\", \"original_document_number\": 3}], \"fallible_previous_answer\": [\"operatic mezzo-soprano\", \"painter\"]}"
